  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_50fb531d-e5a0-493b-9824-08b00b3926d6.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h1><strong>Cosmos Decorations</strong></h1>\n<h3><strong>注意事项</strong></h3>\n<p>Cosmos Decorations 现已支持 <strong>1.21.1</strong>。</p>\n<h3><strong>简介</strong></h3>\n<p>Cosmos Decorations 是一款轻量级模组，添加了多种装饰性方块，包括原版方块的楼梯和台阶、各类原版方块的石材变体等。</p>\n<h3><strong>依赖项</strong></h3>\n<p>Cosmos Decorations 需要 <strong>Cosmos Library</strong> 才能运行，请下载最新版 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmos-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<h2><strong>The Cosmos Series</strong></h2>\n<p>本模组属于 <strong><a href=\"https://www.github.com/TheCosmosSeries\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Cosmos Series</a></strong>。</p>",
